# Example torrc for HashChat desktop.
# Copy the ControlPort / SocksPort / Cookie lines into your system torrc
# (do not run this file as-is if paths do not exist on your distro).

SocksPort 9050
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 1
SocksPolicy accept 127.0.0.1
SocksPolicy reject *
SafeLogging 1
